This '''base''' was a [[Confederacy of Independent Systems/Legends|Confederacy of Independent Systems]] chemical factory located on the [[Planet/Legends|planet]] [[Queyta]] during the [[Clone Wars/Legends|Clone Wars]]. The base was located on a small island that flowed along a river of [[Magma/Legends|lava]]. It was where the [[Bioweapon/Legends|chemical weapon]] [[swamp gas]] was being manufactured.<ref name="Republic 53" />

It was destroyed in [[22 BBY/Legends|21.7 BBY]] by a strike team of five [[Jedi Master/Legends|Jedi Masters]] which consisted of of [[Obi-Wan Kenobi/Legends|Obi-Wan Kenobi]] and four nomadic [[Jedi/Legends|Jedi]]: the [[Bothan/Legends|Bothan]] [[Knol Ven'nari]], the mysterious [[Jon Antilles]], the renowned emancipator of [[Slavery/Legends|slaves]] [[Nico Diath]], and the ancient Jedi Master [[Fay]]. The objective of their [[Mission to Queyta|mission]] was to retrieve an antidote for swamp gas before the Separatist could use it against the [[Clone trooper/Legends|clone troopers]] of the [[Grand Army of the Republic/Legends|Grand Army of the Republic]]. Unbeknownst to the Jedi, Separatist [[Commander/Legends|commander]] [[Asajj Ventress/Legends|Asajj Ventress]] and the [[Gen'Dai/Legends|Gen'Dai]] [[Assassin/Legends|assassin]] [[Durge/Legends|Durge]] were aware of their mission and prepared accordingly for their arrival. A skirmish ensued inside the factory where in Durge shot a [[Skakoan/Legends|Skakoan]] sentry with his [[Blaster/Legends|blaster]]. Due to the pressurized suits the Skakoans were wearing in order to accommodate their need to breathe [[Methane/Legends|methane]], a large explosion occurred which compromised the facility and caused it to sink.<ref name="Republic 53" />

